<title>SINGAPORE: Alliance 1st-half net loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Alliance 1st-half net loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss					 3.39 vs   1.59</p>
<p>Group shr loss (cents)		     0.06 vs   0.03</p>
<p>    Turnover					17.30 vs  11.93</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest		0.30 vs   0.07</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)			   1.45 vs   0.91</p>
<p>    Depreciation				   2.87 vs   2.99</p>
<p>    Profits from associates		    0.26 vs   0.01 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax				     (gain) 0.04 vs   0.03</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Alliance Technology and Development Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
